{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"mantian-e-o119","title":"招答峭王辽东何得擅拜假","accounts":[{"id":"mantian-a-432f397122f428413450","label":"正文","text":"招答峭王辽东何得擅拜假","evidence":["mantian-q-62eed4e6ae2d1cce40eb"]}],"participants":[{"person":"mantian-p0025","role":"答昔袁公承制、辽东下郡何得擅拜假","evidence":["mantian-q-62eed4e6ae2d1cce40eb"]},{"person":"mantian-p0055","role":"辩沧海拥兵强者为右","evidence":["mantian-q-62eed4e6ae2d1cce40eb"]},{"person":"mantian-p0009","role":"问三命孰正","evidence":["mantian-q-62eed4e6ae2d1cce40eb"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["mantian-q-62eed4e6ae2d1cce40eb"]},"ordering_evidence":"mantian-q-62eed4e6ae2d1cce40eb","source_order":[26,215,0],"order":5219}],"persons":[{"id":"mantian-p0009","name":"峭王","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"mantian-p0025","name":"牵招","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"mantian-p0055","name":"韩忠","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"mantian-q-62eed4e6ae2d1cce40eb","section":"chapter-026","block":"b-81c5af75b6aa7cb02926","layer":"original","quote":"峭王问招：“昔袁公言受天子之命，假我为单于；今曹公复言‘当更白天子，假我真单于’；辽东复持印绶来。如此，谁当为正？”招答曰：“昔袁公承制〖5〗，得有所拜假〖6〗；中间违错〖7〗，天子命曹公代之，言‘当白天子，更假真单于’，是也。辽东下郡，何得擅称拜假也？”忠曰：“我辽东在沧海之东，拥兵百万；又有扶余、濊貊之用〖8〗。当今之势，强者为右〖9〗。曹操独何得为是也","section_title":"满田牵郭传第二十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0058.xhtml","index":214,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":180}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
